fixture two_parries_in_a_slow
doc Presentation review r3, M1 and H1: a second parry lands on frame 68, inside the first parry's six slow ticks (66 to 71); its slow motion must wait for its own hitstop, and its full-screen flash is shown for one frame (test_sim_driver_slow_motion).
room test/two_parries
frames 100
input
  46 L attack
  64 attack
end
expect
  at 53 event.parry=1 hearts=5
  at 68 event.parry=1 hearts=5
  never 0..99 event.player_hit=1
end
